== Etymology==
Whampire's name is a portmanteau of "wham", which is onomatopoeic, coming from hitting something very hard as well as the name of the band ''[[wikipedia:Wham!|Wham!]]'',{{Refn|[[:File:Whampire name origin.png]]|group = DJW}} and "vampire", referencing his appearance.

His name is also a reference to Count Wampyr, the original name [[Wikipedia:Bram Stoker|Bram Stoker]] conceived for [[Wikipedia:Count Dracula|Count Dracula]].

The name also sounds like the word "vampire" spoken in a stereotypical Transylvanian or Eastern European accent, which vampires are traditionally given in media.

==Trivia==
*Whampire is the final alien introduced in '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''', as well as in the Classic Continuity as a whole.
*Whampire speaks with a [[wikipedia:Hungary|Hungarian]] accent, in reference to actor [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bela_Lugosi Bela Lugosi], who had portrayed [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Count_Dracula Count Dracula] in the 1931 horror classic [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dracula_(1931_English-language_film) ''Dracula''].
*As the [[Vladat]]s are a functionally extinct race, Whampire and [[Lord Transyl]] are the only remaining Vladats in the [[Universe (Classic)|universe]].
*Whampire is the only alien introduced in '''Omniverse''' who was unlocked through obtaining a DNA sample. However, unlike most other aliens that were unlocked through this procedure, Whampire's DNA sample was acquired in extraordinary circumstances: Lord Transyl was brought back to life by [[Zs'Skayr]] using the immense [[Magic (Classic)|magical]] power he stole from the [[Alpha Rune]].<ref name="TVSB" />
*Whampire's ability to turn into a chibi-fied bat is an actual power and not just for comedic effect.{{Refn|group = DJW|name = chibi}} [[Derrick J. Wyatt]] drew how his bat form would look like normally long after the show ended.{{Refn|[[:File:Whampire Bat Halloween DJW.png]]|group = DJW}}
* [[Albedo]] is unable to transform into Whampire.{{Refn|[[:File:Albedo Cannot Add More Aliens.png]]|group = DJW}}
*Derrick J. Wyatt came up with Whampire{{Refn|[[:File:Derrick Came Up With Whampire.png]]|group = DJW}} and designed his appearance, which were based on his roughs, alongside Steven Choi.{{Refn|[[:File:Whampire designers.png]]|group = DJW}}
**Whampire is modeled after the [[Wikipedia:Marvel Comics|Marvel Comics]] character [[wikipedia:Baron Blood|Baron Blood]].{{Refn|[[:File:Whampire Inspiration.png]]|group = DJW}}

